# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At a high level, optimizers are central to exploring our search space. The optimizer uses cost function evaluations to select the next set of parameters in a variational loop, and repeats the process until it reaches a stable state. At this stage, an optimal set of parameter values $\\vec\\theta^*$ is returned.\n"
msgstr "Na wysokim poziomie optymalizatory są kluczowe dla eksplorowania przestrzeni poszukiwań. Optymalizator używa ewaluacji funkcji kosztu do wyboru kolejnego zestawu parametrów w pętli wariacyjnej i powtarza ten proces, aż osiągnie stabilny stan. Na tym etapie zwracany jest optymalny zestaw wartości parametrów $\\vec\\theta^*$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A diagram of some important factors in optimization, including barren plateaus, gradient vs gradient-free optimizers, and bootstrapping.](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/optimization-loops/optimization-workflow.svg)\n"
msgstr "![A diagram of some important factors in optimization, including barren plateaus, gradient vs gradient-free optimizers, and bootstrapping.](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/optimization-loops/optimization-workflow.svg)\n"

